# CommonsBase_Win32

## Overview

Wine 11.2-based Windows support components for dk workspaces, with a Diskuv `Wenv` wrapper for entering Wine-backed Windows build environments on Unix.

`CommonsBase_Win32` ships three primary targets: `Wine.Bundle@11.2.0`
(the upstream Wine source), `Wine@11.2.0` (the cross-built Wine
toolchain), and `Wenv@0.1.0` (a rule that creates a Windows build
environment and its `bin/enter` launcher). The bundled `wait-wineserver.sh`
helper is derived from the ISC-licensed msvc-wine project; the other
wrapper scripts and rules are Diskuv-authored.

## License

Apache-2.0 AND ISC AND LGPL-2.1-or-later

